Cell["\<\
For compact output below, q00 denotes Q00(nu), tGamma denotes T(nu)=2^(-1-2 I \
nu) Gamma(1+2 I nu), and eEndpoint denotes E(nu). H0fin is FP H0(I nu+delta,I \
nu+delta;1); H1fin is FP H1(1+I nu+delta,I nu+delta;1). Their finite endpoint \
terms are retained.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7f8143cb-bcdb-464b-83b0-eb09bd6f9ae7"],

