Cell["\<\
In this factored table bb = softBTop(nu), pp1 = P1Top(nu), pp2 = P2Top(nu). \
The next saved output writes these mass-dependent functions explicitly. P1Top \
and P2Top have the fully substituted analytic expressions shown in Section 4.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"8b542d90-8ed9-4747-906f-a1fc8a2169ad"],

